		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Bat-winged, ghoulish psychic lurker that dwells near humanoids, feeding on them from the Astral Plane.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 25, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +4 (1d6) or 1 touch +4 (drain), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Astral Projection</strong>. Project incorporeal, invisible psychic form while physical body is in statis. Can only use touch attack while astral. If body is destroyed, projection is as well, and vice versa.</p><p></p><p><strong>Drain</strong>. 1d4 CON damage. Death if reduced to 0 CON.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
